    "note": "The complete 29-page card is specific to Grok 4.5. Other Grok, Claude, GPT, Gemini, GLM, and Mythos models appear only as comparison rows in xAI's charts or tables. This digest treats those numbers as comparators, not as evidence about Grok 4.5, and omits most reference-list detail."
